# FilamentRewards

Filament Rewards is the administrative entry point for Rewards. Read program-scoped records through `AIArmada\FilamentRewards\Queries\RewardProgramScopeQuery`; delegate durable mutations to Rewards Actions. A staff role or explicit `reward-staff` Gate for users without role methods is required at staff-only entry points. Use `RewardAdminPresenter::staffActor()` to require a valid authentication identifier and `getAuthIdentifier()` for staff attribution, rather than assuming the actor is an Eloquent model. Fraud stewardship requires both staff access and the `reward-fraud-steward` ability. Recheck staff access and applicable operation-specific abilities inside handlers, including read-only qualification previews, not only in button visibility. When verifying a pending payee, pass its registration identity in `verified_from_registration_id`; stale or mismatched registrations must be refused. Never widen tenant scope for a record mutation. Do not add compatibility aliases.

Read budget and benefit stock balances through `AIArmada\Rewards\Features\Finance\Api\RewardBudgetReadApi` and `AIArmada\Rewards\Features\Benefits\Api\RewardBenefitStockReadApi`; both validate the current program owner scope before reading the ledger.
